OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny showers
OL,6,Fthis evening fading to give a largely
OL,7,Fdry night with clear spells across the
OL,8,Fregion, chance of an occasional shower
OL,9,Facross parts of Cumbria though.
OL,10,FStaying fairly warm and muggy still.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA dry and bright start, but
OL,13,Fturning increasing cloudy from mid-
OL,14,Fmorning with outbreaks of heavy rain
OL,15,Freaching the region and persisting
OL,16,Fduring much of the day. Temperatures
OL,17,Faround average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
